{"seq":2,"slug":"affected-testing","title":"受影响分析与精准测试：git diff → task graph → selective run","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-monorepo-tooling/code-quality/affected-testing","wordCount":1107,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"受影响分析与精准测试-git-diff-task-graph-selective-run\">受影响分析与精准测试：git diff → task graph → selective run</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>术语</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>受影响分析（Affected Analysis）</td>\n<td>从 git 变更文件出发，通过项目图反向推导最小需要重新执行任务的包集合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>选择性执行（Selective Run）</td>\n<td>只对受影响的包执行构建/测试/lint，跳过未变更包</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>基准分支（base）</td>\n<td>受影响分析的对比起点，通常是 <code>main</code> 或 PR 的目标分支</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>传递影响（Transitive Impact）</td>\n<td>若包 A 的变更影响包 B，包 B 的变更又影响包 C，则 A 的变更对 C 也有传递影响</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>任务图剪枝</td>\n<td>在完整任务 DAG 上移除不受影响的节点，得到最小执行集合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>变更集（Change Set）</td>\n<td>一次 PR 或提交中实际发生变化的文件集合</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"受影响分析的完整链路\">受影响分析的完整链路</h2><p>受影响分析解决的核心问题是：<strong>在拥有数十甚至上百个包的 Monorepo 中，如何只测试真正受本次变更影响的包，而不是每次都全量测试？</strong></p>\n<p>完整链路分为三步：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[&quot;Step 1: git diff\\n识别变更文件&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;Step 2: 项目图查询\\n找出直接受影响包&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;Step 3: 反向遍历\\n找出间接受影响包&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;Step 4: 任务图剪枝\\n生成最小执行集合&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;Step 5: 并行执行\\n只跑受影响的任务&quot;]\">graph LR\n    A[\"Step 1: git diff\\n识别变更文件\"] --&gt; B[\"Step 2: 项目图查询\\n找出直接受影响包\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"Step 3: 反向遍历\\n找出间接受影响包\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"Step 4: 任务图剪枝\\n生成最小执行集合\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"Step 5: 并行执行\\n只跑受影响的任务\"]</pre><h3 id=\"step-1-git-diff-识别变更文件\">Step 1：git diff 识别变更文件</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 对比 main 分支，找出变更文件列表&#10;git diff --name-only origin/main...HEAD&#10;&#10;# 示例输出&#10;packages/utils/src/format.ts&#10;packages/utils/src/index.ts&#10;tooling/eslint-config/src/base.js\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 对比 main 分支，找出变更文件列表</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> diff</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --name-only</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> origin/main...HEAD</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 示例输出</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">packages/utils/src/format.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">packages/utils/src/index.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">tooling/eslint-config/src/base.js</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"step-2-将变更文件映射到包\">Step 2：将变更文件映射到包</h3><p>将变更文件路径与各包目录匹配，确定<strong>直接变更的包</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>packages/utils/src/format.ts</code> → <code>packages/utils</code></li>\n<li><code>tooling/eslint-config/src/base.js</code> → <code>tooling/eslint-config</code></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"step-3-反向遍历项目图\">Step 3：反向遍历项目图</h3><p>在项目图中找出所有依赖变更包的包（传递闭包）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"packages/utils 被变更&#10;  ↓ (被 packages/ui 依赖)&#10;packages/ui 受影响&#10;  ↓ (被 apps/web 依赖)&#10;apps/web 受影响&#10;  ↓ (被 apps/mobile 依赖)&#10;apps/mobile 受影响&#10;&#10;tooling/eslint-config 被变更&#10;  ↓ (被所有包通过 devDependencies 引用)&#10;packages/utils, packages/ui, apps/web, apps/mobile 全部受影响\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>packages/utils 被变更</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ↓ (被 packages/ui 依赖)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>packages/ui 受影响</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ↓ (被 apps/web 依赖)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>apps/web 受影响</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ↓ (被 apps/mobile 依赖)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>apps/mobile 受影响</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>tooling/eslint-config 被变更</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ↓ (被所有包通过 devDependencies 引用)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>packages/utils, packages/ui, apps/web, apps/mobile 全部受影响</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"nx-affected-实践\">Nx Affected 实践</h2><p>Nx 提供最精确的受影响分析，基于源码级项目图。</p>\n<h3 id=\"基础命令\">基础命令</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 查看受影响的项目列表（不执行任务）&#10;nx affected:graph&#10;&#10;# 仅查看受影响的项目名称&#10;nx show projects --affected&#10;&#10;# 对受影响项目运行 test&#10;nx affected -t test&#10;&#10;# 对受影响项目运行多个任务（并行）&#10;nx affected -t build test lint --parallel=3&#10;&#10;# 指定对比基准&#10;nx affected -t test --base=origin/main --head=HEAD&#10;&#10;# PR 场景：使用 PR 目标分支作为基准&#10;nx affected -t test --base=origin/$TARGET_BRANCH --head=HEAD\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 查看受影响的项目列表（不执行任务）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> affected:graph</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 仅查看受影响的项目名称</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> show</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> projects</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --affected</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 对受影响项目运行 test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> affected</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -t</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 对受影响项目运行多个任务（并行）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> affected</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -t</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> test</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> lint</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --parallel=3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 指定对比基准</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> affected</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -t</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> test</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --base=origin/main</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --head=HEAD</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># PR 场景：使用 PR 目标分支作为基准</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> affected</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -t</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> test</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --base=origin/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$TARGET_BRANCH</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --head=HEAD</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"github-actions-完整示例\">GitHub Actions 完整示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"name: CI&#10;on:&#10;  pull_request:&#10;    branches: [main]&#10;&#10;jobs:&#10;  affected-check:&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    outputs:&#10;      has-affected: ${{ steps.affected.outputs.count &gt; 0 }}&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;        with:&#10;          fetch-depth: 0 # 必须拉取完整历史，否则 affected 分析不准确&#10;&#10;      - uses: pnpm/action-setup@v3&#10;      - uses: actions/setup-node@v4&#10;        with:&#10;          node-version: 20&#10;          cache: &#39;pnpm&#39;&#10;&#10;      - run: pnpm install --frozen-lockfile&#10;&#10;      - name: Run affected tasks&#10;        run: |&#10;          nx affected -t build test lint \\&#10;            --base=origin/${{ github.base_ref }} \\&#10;            --head=HEAD \\&#10;            --parallel=3&#10;        env:&#10;          NX_CLOUD_ACCESS_TOKEN: ${{ secrets.NX_CLOUD_ACCESS_TOKEN }}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">CI</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  pull_request</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    branches</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">main</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">jobs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  affected-check</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    runs-on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ubuntu-latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    outputs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      has-affected</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${{ steps.affected.outputs.count > 0 }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/checkout@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          fetch-depth</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 必须拉取完整历史，否则 affected 分析不准确</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm/action-setup@v3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/setup-node@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          node-version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          cache</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'pnpm'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm install --frozen-lockfile</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Run affected tasks</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          nx affected -t build test lint \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            --base=origin/${{ github.base_ref }} \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            --head=HEAD \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            --parallel=3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        env</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          NX_CLOUD_ACCESS_TOKEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${{ secrets.NX_CLOUD_ACCESS_TOKEN }}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>fetch-depth: 0</code> 是关键配置——默认的浅克隆（shallow clone）只有最新提交，会导致 git diff 无法正确对比目标分支，进而使所有包都被标记为&quot;受影响&quot;，失去精准测试的效果。</p>\n<h2 id=\"turborepo-的过滤机制\">Turborepo 的过滤机制</h2><p>Turborepo 没有内置的 affected 分析，但通过 <code>--filter</code> 配合 git 语法实现类似功能：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 过滤自 main 分支以来有变更的包及其依赖方&#10;turbo build test --filter=&#39;...[origin/main]&#39;&#10;&#10;# 仅过滤有变更的包（不含传递依赖方）&#10;turbo test --filter=&#39;[origin/main]&#39;&#10;&#10;# 在 GitHub Actions 中&#10;turbo build test --filter=&#39;...[origin/${{ github.base_ref }}]&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 过滤自 main 分支以来有变更的包及其依赖方</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">turbo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> test</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --filter=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'...[origin/main]'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 仅过滤有变更的包（不含传递依赖方）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">turbo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> test</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --filter=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'[origin/main]'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 在 GitHub Actions 中</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">turbo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> test</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --filter=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'...[origin/${{ github.base_ref }}]'</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>[origin/main]</code> 语法会找出与 <code>origin/main</code> 相比有变更的包，<code>...</code> 前缀表示&quot;及所有依赖这些包的包&quot;（传递影响）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"turborepo-vs-nx-受影响分析的差异\">Turborepo vs Nx 受影响分析的差异</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>Turborepo <code>--filter</code></th>\n<th>Nx <code>affected</code></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>依赖感知</td>\n<td>基于 package.json 声明</td>\n<td>源码级 import 分析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>精确度</td>\n<td>中（无法感知未声明的隐式依赖）</td>\n<td>高（捕获动态导入等隐式依赖）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>配置要求</td>\n<td>无额外配置</td>\n<td>需要 nx.json 配置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>速度</td>\n<td>快</td>\n<td>中（首次需要构建项目图）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"受影响分析的常见问题与解决\">受影响分析的常见问题与解决</h2><h3 id=\"问题一-所有包都被标记为受影响\">问题一：所有包都被标记为受影响</h3><p><strong>原因</strong>：通常是修改了根目录的配置文件（如 <code>package.json</code>、<code>pnpm-lock.yaml</code>、<code>turbo.json</code>、<code>nx.json</code>），或 git 浅克隆导致无法正确对比。</p>\n<p><strong>解决方案</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>确认 CI 中使用 <code>fetch-depth: 0</code></li>\n<li>为根目录配置文件变更设置豁免规则（如 <code>.nxignore</code>）：</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# .nxignore（类似 .gitignore，告知 Nx 忽略这些文件的变更）&#10;*.md&#10;.prettierrc\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># .nxignore（类似 .gitignore，告知 Nx 忽略这些文件的变更）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.md</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.prettierrc</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"问题二-受影响分析遗漏了真正受影响的包\">问题二：受影响分析遗漏了真正受影响的包</h3><p><strong>原因</strong>：包之间的依赖关系未在项目图中正确声明（如使用了 <code>paths</code> 别名但未在 <code>package.json</code> 中声明依赖）。</p>\n<p><strong>解决方案</strong>：确保所有内部依赖都通过 <code>workspace:*</code> 在 <code>package.json</code> 中声明，不依赖隐式路径解析。</p>\n<h3 id=\"问题三-锁文件变更触发全量重新构建\">问题三：锁文件变更触发全量重新构建</h3><p><strong>原因</strong>：<code>pnpm-lock.yaml</code> 变更通常意味着依赖版本发生变化，工具保守地将所有包标记为受影响。</p>\n<p><strong>解决方案</strong>：接受这个行为（依赖变更确实可能影响任何包）；或者区分&quot;仅 lockfile 格式变更&quot;（无新依赖）和&quot;实质依赖变更&quot;，前者可豁免全量触发。</p>\n<h2 id=\"精准测试的测试选择策略\">精准测试的测试选择策略</h2><p>受影响分析确定了&quot;哪些包需要重新测试&quot;，但在包内部还可以进一步精细化。</p>\n<h3 id=\"jest-的项目级过滤\">Jest 的项目级过滤</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 仅运行受影响包的测试&#10;nx affected -t test&#10;&#10;# 在某个包内，仅运行与变更文件相关的测试&#10;jest --changedSince=origin/main\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 仅运行受影响包的测试</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> affected</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -t</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 在某个包内，仅运行与变更文件相关的测试</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">jest</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --changedSince=origin/main</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"vitest-的相关文件过滤\">Vitest 的相关文件过滤</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# Vitest 的 related 模式，基于模块图确定相关测试文件&#10;vitest related packages/utils/src/format.ts\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Vitest 的 related 模式，基于模块图确定相关测试文件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">vitest</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> related</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> packages/utils/src/format.ts</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>受影响分析与精准测试是 Monorepo CI 效率的核心保障：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>传递影响不可遗漏</strong>：变更 A 影响 B，B 影响 C，C 的测试也必须运行</li>\n<li><strong><code>fetch-depth: 0</code> 是前提</strong>：CI 浅克隆会破坏 git diff 分析，必须拉取完整历史</li>\n<li><strong>Nx affected 比 Turborepo filter 更精确</strong>：源码级依赖分析能捕获未声明的隐式依赖</li>\n<li><strong>根目录文件变更谨慎处理</strong>：tooling 配置变更可能触发全量构建，这通常是正确的</li>\n<li><strong>锁文件变更接受全量触发</strong>：依赖版本变化确实可能影响任何包的行为</li>\n<li><strong>受影响分析 + Remote Cache 是黄金组合</strong>：未受影响的包从缓存恢复，受影响的包选择性执行</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>本章节相关文档：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"shared-config-conventions\">共享配置与约定</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"versioning-publishing\">版本管理与发布</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"受影响分析与精准测试：git diff → task graph → selective run","id":"受影响分析与精准测试-git-diff-task-graph-selective-run"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"受影响分析的完整链路","id":"受影响分析的完整链路"},{"level":3,"text":"Step 1：git diff 识别变更文件","id":"step-1-git-diff-识别变更文件"},{"level":3,"text":"Step 2：将变更文件映射到包","id":"step-2-将变更文件映射到包"},{"level":3,"text":"Step 3：反向遍历项目图","id":"step-3-反向遍历项目图"},{"level":2,"text":"Nx Affected 实践","id":"nx-affected-实践"},{"level":3,"text":"基础命令","id":"基础命令"},{"level":3,"text":"GitHub Actions 完整示例","id":"github-actions-完整示例"},{"level":2,"text":"Turborepo 的过滤机制","id":"turborepo-的过滤机制"},{"level":3,"text":"Turborepo vs Nx 受影响分析的差异","id":"turborepo-vs-nx-受影响分析的差异"},{"level":2,"text":"受影响分析的常见问题与解决","id":"受影响分析的常见问题与解决"},{"level":3,"text":"问题一：所有包都被标记为受影响","id":"问题一-所有包都被标记为受影响"},{"level":3,"text":"问题二：受影响分析遗漏了真正受影响的包","id":"问题二-受影响分析遗漏了真正受影响的包"},{"level":3,"text":"问题三：锁文件变更触发全量重新构建","id":"问题三-锁文件变更触发全量重新构建"},{"level":2,"text":"精准测试的测试选择策略","id":"精准测试的测试选择策略"},{"level":3,"text":"Jest 的项目级过滤","id":"jest-的项目级过滤"},{"level":3,"text":"Vitest 的相关文件过滤","id":"vitest-的相关文件过滤"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"共享配置与约定：ESLint/TSConfig/Prettier 跨包统一","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-monorepo-tooling/code-quality/shared-config-conventions"},"next":{"title":"版本管理与发布：Changesets、Lerna 与 semantic-release","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-monorepo-tooling/code-quality/versioning-publishing"}}